{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "hero",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# PROMETHEUS NEURAL GLASS\n## Local-first intelligence, visibly governed\nSanitized system map · no private note bodies or filenames",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 180,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "signals",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 01 · DELIBERATE SIGNALS\n- Repository metadata\n- Human-reviewed exports\n- Approved news artifacts\n- Selected images and usage records",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "trust",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 02 · TRUST GATE\n- Exact source boundary\n- Classification check\n- Size and type validation\n- No implicit publishing",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 250,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "memory",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 03 · IMMUTABLE MEMORY\n**Exact bytes → SHA-256 identity**\n\nFirst-capture sidecar + append-only observations + atomic cursor + audit ledger",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 550,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "knowledge",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 04 · REVIEWABLE KNOWLEDGE\n- Source-linked manifests\n- Protected user sections\n- Explicit uncertainty\n- Freshness checks",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "learning",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 05 · DECISIONS + LEARNING\n- Evidence-gated FDE roadmap\n- Assessments and retrieval\n- Decision records\n- One active outcome",
      "x": 400,
      "y": 850,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "output",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 06 · CONTROLLED OUTPUT\n### Briefs · demos · next actions · handoffs\nEverything stays reviewable. External effects require a deliberate decision.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1150,
      "width": 760,
      "height": 230,
      "color": "4"
    }
  ],
